  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Recently, with the AI label poll that was done, despite receiving over 21,000 entries, a lot of users are suggesting that the poll is invalid because:\n\n1) It was conducted outside VRChat\n\n2) The poll was only shared on social media\n\n3) The poll did not represent a large enough sample of the VRChat user base\n\nI think creating a poll system inside the game itself, pushing a notification to users/using the news carousel in the menu, and even offering a free item for users would help. It could even be a simple \"I Voted!\" accessory that is themed around each poll. I actually think it would help engage the userbase more and encourage us to work together as a community.\n\nThis could also include a way for any user to download anonymized polling data so they can do data analysis themselves.",
